  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Climate Compatible Development in the Caribbean Through Business and Investment Opps</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project was developed by two consultants, Patricia Londono and Laura Rodriguez, who previously worked with Carolina in Columbia.  The project came out of an EDF project done in the Caribbean region last year, and focuses on  capacity building and development of business models, including provision of scholarships, mentorships, market studies, financing guarantees, seed funding, policy analysis and improvement, development of project pipelines.</narrative>
  </description>
